.omx/
# OMC working state. Only .omc/specs/ is durable and committed — DESIGN.md and
# app/globals.css reference spec paths that must resolve in every clone.
# Everything else under .omc/ (plans, state, sessions, project-memory) is
# session-local. The glob-then-unignore form keeps any future .omc/ entry
# ignored by default rather than silently untracked.
.omc/*
!.omc/specs/
